I'm small for 140.
I'd like to come down to lightweight.
And he's got to move on lightweight [135 pounds] and then we're fighting.
That's what the fans demand.
Let's give that to them.'
Lohomenko agreed.
"Boxing needs this fight."
Klimas asked if it should be on pay-per-view, part of a strategy Lomachenko will have to fight with a 135-pound debut this year to agree a date with Garcia next summer (37-0, 30 knockouts) who is also interested in fighting Jorge Linares-Luke Campbell's winner after their lightweight title fight in the forum on September 23.
